{"overview":"در این درام حقوقی، شما قاضی جکس استوارت را به‌خاطر اخلاقیات مشکوک و تفسیرهای وحشیانه‌اش از قانون می‌سنجید… تا وقتی که خودتان در مشکل می‌افتید. آن‌گاه می‌بینید او چه کسی است: باهوش‌ترین و بی‌باک‌ترین وکیل دفاعی لس آنجلس که در هر فرصتی به نظام قضایی چالش می‌کشد.","tagline":"","overview_en":"In this legal drama, you’ll judge Jax Stewart for her questionable ethics and wild interpretations of the law… until you’re the one in trouble. Then you’ll see her for what she is: the most brilliant and fearless defense attorney in Los Angeles who bucks the justice system at every chance she gets.","tagline_en":"It all comes apart.","runtime":null,"status":"Returning Series","seasons":[{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":9,"y":2022,"poster":"/aRKe0CL8djP3j72Lu8bsod7qaG.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":10,"y":2024,"poster":"/rg7eeP3fCSfmOpgY62VeYPFh5tG.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":10,"y":2025,"poster":"/3I6GwIbRKlym6hFw1weEUdgTFFT.jpg"},{"n":4,"name":"فصل 4","ep":10,"y":2026,"poster":"/v9p9VbljJdJ9GjLqp3l5YpWJ8HO.jpg"}],"episodes":39,"crew":["Raamla Mohamed"],"crew_en":[],"countries":["US"],"cast":[{"name":"Emayatzy Corinealdi","role":"Jax Stewart","photo":"/yjc72CjOicfI4LxdoIQJ3VwpKF0.jpg"},{"name":"McKinley Freeman","role":"Lewis Stewart","photo":"/lz5RBu2RF46PflvqcCSaR2Y0HHT.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Jo","role":"Daniel Kim","photo":"/oHWsKvsZAALSiHDXe0ezgApfd8c.jpg"},{"name":"Angela Grovey","role":"Krystal Walters","photo":"/sOru70eAupeB05Bwxm7790jwtqA.jpg"},{"name":"لا لا آنتونی","role":"Melina Cropper","photo":"/fRtEDfU0gX1mBXfmVpEVs5RBXdq.jpg","en":"La La Anthony"},{"name":"Tank","role":"Eric Cropper","photo":"/4rT7a9OukGG6eBz9izKMfOqwWdT.jpg"},{"name":"DeVaughn Nixon","role":"Tyger Cropper","photo":"/grqGei5XcuKNPjOTAZpepOcmmsW.jpg"},{"name":"Aderinsola Olabode","role":"Naima Stewart","photo":"/g7sbyEnwenPeKBHUQWJwZOG1Na9.jpg"},{"name":"Shannon Kane","role":"Shanelle Tucker","photo":"/gmmy7uKCpDz7kXA08s9EBJNs7vN.jpg"},{"name":"Taylor Polidore","role":"Brooke Cropper","photo